pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 389.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"520\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multiple palmoplantar keratoses</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 389.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"520\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multifocal cutaneous facial papules</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 389.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"520\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Macular pigmentation of the glans penis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multiple gastrointestinal hamartomas or ganglioneuromas<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Minor criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Other thyroid lesions (follicular adenomas, multinodular goitre)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intellectual disability (i.e. IQ&nbsp;&le;&nbsp;75)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"PT\">Gastrointestinal hamartomas<sup>a</sup> (single gastrointestinal hamartoma or ganglioneuroma<sup>b</sup>)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fibrocystic breast disease</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lipomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fibromas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Genitourinary tumours (especially renal cell carcinoma)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Genitourinary malformations<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Uterine fibroids</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Autism spectrum disorder<sup>b</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 411.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"548\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Relaxed ICC operational criteria for Cowden syndrome:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 382.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"510\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">At least one pathognomonic criterion</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 382.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"510\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 382.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"510\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">At least two criteria, either major or minor</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border: none;\" width=\"28\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: none;\" width=\"9\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"border: none;\" width=\"510\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">a</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Present in this section as defined by ICC criteria only. <sup>b</sup>Present in this section as defined by National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) criteria <span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\">[[Dragoo DD, Taher A, Wong VK, et al. PTEN Hamartoma Tumor Syndrome/Cowden Syndrome: Genomics, Oncogenesis, and Imaging Review for Associated Lesions and Malignancy. Cancers (Basel). 2021 Jun 22;13(13):3120. PMID 34206559.]] {;24136893}</span>.</span></p>",
