    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;2.43</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Lifetime cancer risks and general screening recommendations in Cowden syndrome and <em>PTEN</em> hamartoma tumour syndrome </span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission, from: WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Digestive system tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2019. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.who.int/579.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"689\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cancer</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Lifetime risk</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Age of cancer diagnosis, years</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Predominant histology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Recommended screening</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast (female)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Up to 85%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">38&ndash;50</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ductal adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at the age of 30&nbsp;years: annual mammogram; consider MRI for patients with dense breasts</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Thyroid</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Up to 35%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">37 (median) <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Follicular (mostly) and papillary carcinoma <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{21956414}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at the age of 12&nbsp;years: annual ultrasound</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Endometrium</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Up to 28%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">30&ndash;40 <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Endometrioid adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at the age of 35&nbsp;years: annual endometrial biopsy or transvaginal ultrasound (postmenopausal); prophylactic hysterectomy can be considered after childbearing is complete or from the age of 40&nbsp;years <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{25132236}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Renal cell</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Up to 34%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">40&ndash;50 <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mostly papillary neoplasms <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at the age of 40&nbsp;years: renal imaging every 1&ndash;2&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Colon</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Up to 16%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">35&ndash;49</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at the age of 35&nbsp;years: colonoscopy every 5&nbsp;years, or closer intervals if polyps are found <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{35487791}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Melanoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"75\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">6%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Unknown</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not applicable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"208\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Annual dermatological examination</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">References: {22252256; 23613428; 23335809; 21956414; 24778394; 35487791; 32533092; 25132236}.</p>",
